{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"screens\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"漏掉了一个重要愿望：他不只是希望坦白能让美好持续，还盼着对方也喜欢那个不再小心隐藏心意的自己。把这一层简化成希望对方看见真实的自己，少了对方是否接纳、喜欢自己的期待。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把感受概括成羞怯，原文的重点其实是暴露在意后的空落、无措和对亲近关系的疏离感；还包含松开手、放下攥紧对方冲动的心理变化，不只是慌张和脆弱。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把踏实当成他的主要感受，混淆了主体：原文说的是他希望对方跟自己在一起也能安心，而他自己的感受是高兴得收不住、心里一紧，以及被强烈欲望、执念和生命眷恋卷入。观众的概括弱化了这层强烈甚至带情色意味的情绪。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把想到眼下亲近是真实存在，改写成主动提醒自己珍惜，增加了原文没有明确表达的自我劝慰。还漏掉了后半段情绪的转变：不安暂时不再占据全部心思，并且想到对方或许也喜欢自己陪伴时，他其实有一点高兴，并非始终沉浸在恐惧和失落中。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把不再为自己的喜欢感到羞愧概括成无畏，程度稍有偏差。原文并没有说他已经不再害怕或毫无顾虑：他仍然知道未来能否继续亲近不由自己决定，而且想到可能失去时，浓烈的欢喜依然会压得心口发疼。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S14\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"story\": 4,\n  \"story_note\": \"全曲故事与完整稿是同一件事：从害怕自己的需要成为负担，到逐渐接受亲近、渴望相互依靠，再到害怕失去、坦然表达和尽情付出，最后不再强求永远的保证，选择不隐藏喜欢并把未来留给未来，核心心理发展和结局都拼对了。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "24514d1f-35b5-42ae-bcbc-5e02b7126bd6", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261111T033729723623Z", "elapsed_seconds": 134.578, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T03:39:44.310064+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "78f6218097a1a77c2a1e4515bdff2a5d5e76147c580fcd4c039e981b18aa0353", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261111T033729723623Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "bfab14409495aa95b82a1268f4f159706480930b7cebfc14df9d2af811d0f759"}}}
